                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b3874f6-7dd2-4d3a-80bb-505ecd2a14d4",
                                "sense_id": "e6b7763e-e76c-31bf-9602-e6442fff5b33",
                                "text": "„Er spürte nicht, wie ihm die Schamanin die Handflächen mit weichen Streifen gegerbten Rentierfells verband.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ac189993-7e27-445d-984a-95ae9361af58",
                        "source_entry_id": "15d8864a-84be-39e6-8294-115ff7e0fad7",
                        "source_sense_id": "e6b7763e-e76c-31bf-9602-e6442fff5b33",
                        "source_sense_description": "weiblicher Schamane",
                        "target_lang_word": "shaman",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "shaman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2364e5d-485d-3a8b-a0b7-64fad64d7fd7",
                                        "entry_id": "a9029346-a9d4-37ba-bd8f-6cd239367b2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A traditional faith healer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b58cc14f-5baf-3023-ab6f-f37b490eb2fb",
                                        "entry_id": "a9029346-a9d4-37ba-bd8f-6cd239367b2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of certain tribal societies who acts as a spiritual or religious medium between the concrete and spirit worlds; sometimes also a healer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d06ec57-5a96-4a04-9523-fe09f6d637e1",
                                                "sense_id": "b58cc14f-5baf-3023-ab6f-f37b490eb2fb",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: medicine man, medicine woman, priest-doctor, witch doctor"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcde3479-987f-4251-b2e2-f49cdec14875",
                                                "sense_id": "b58cc14f-5baf-3023-ab6f-f37b490eb2fb",
                                                "text": "Shepard: What rites did you go through to become chief shaman?\nShaman: Becoming the shaman is excruciating. I passed through rites that made me wish to die. I carry the scars on my soul.\nShaman: I must perform rites each dawn and dusk to keep me bound into our krogan nature. Our spirit is one of violence and death. I must be attuned to that."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "47c4b9d9-5486-4879-8913-f3b90e1abba1",
                        "source_entry_id": "15d8864a-84be-39e6-8294-115ff7e0fad7",
                        "source_sense_id": "e6b7763e-e76c-31bf-9602-e6442fff5b33",
                        "source_sense_description": "weiblicher Schamane",
                        "target_lang_word": "chamane",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chamane",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a904247e-6051-3268-a4c4-c8cc869d50d8",
                                        "entry_id": "a2461909-dda0-35fd-8647-28485f8197ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dépositaire de la culture, des croyances et des pratiques spirituelles du chamanisme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "058ac0ea-cf2a-4972-adf9-b7804e1d6d4d",
                                                "sense_id": "a904247e-6051-3268-a4c4-c8cc869d50d8",
                                                "text": "Astrologues, guérisseurs et chamanes avaient été consultés, on lui avait prescrit d’avaler, à chaque pleine lune, le prépuce d’un enfant fraîchement circoncis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6e1946a-57c0-4fe0-8e7d-ab5cf7d985dd",
                                                "sense_id": "a904247e-6051-3268-a4c4-c8cc869d50d8",
                                                "text": "… et qui peut parler des heures de la manière dont les chamanes pratiquaient leur art. Lui-même ne cesse de rechercher « les cordes qui parlent de Dieu et du diable, cachés dans certaines sonorités archaïques… »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9e61023-8d6a-44f8-9cd2-c2e5554faf9d",
                                                "sense_id": "a904247e-6051-3268-a4c4-c8cc869d50d8",
                                                "text": "Médiateur entre le monde des vivants et le monde invisible, le chamane communique avec l'esprit des morts, tout d'abord avec celui des animaux, puis avec celui des humains."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8de7b492-cd6f-47e7-b8b5-5046fb645ac5",
                                                "sense_id": "a904247e-6051-3268-a4c4-c8cc869d50d8",
                                                "text": "Le hataali — le chamane — n’a rien pu faire. Elle a rejoint ses ancêtres à présent…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "chamane",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
